:: FreezeHunt [noreturn nobr] {"position":"2700,1225","size":"100,100"}
/* Freeze-and-let-it-pass: third branch alongside Run / Hide. Pays
 * every worn garment + a bank of tempCorr. EMF + UVL are already
 * armed for every prowl path by beginProwlEvent, so they do not
 * need to be re-activated here. With nothing left to give, the
 * ghost takes the player instead and routes to HuntOverSanity.
 * Strips via the canonical Steal* leaf passages (which own both
 * the wardrobe strip + the floor-plan pin via
 * setup.HuntController.stealClothes) so wardrobe variant state +
 * rememberTopOuter/rememberBottomOuter stay consistent. */
<<set _hasTop to setup.Wardrobe.worn(setup.WardrobeSlot.TSHIRT)>>
<<set _hasBottom to setup.Wardrobe.hasBottomWorn()>>
<<set _hasPanties to setup.Wardrobe.worn(setup.WardrobeSlot.PANTIES)>>
<<set _hasBra to setup.Wardrobe.worn(setup.WardrobeSlot.BRA)>>
<<set _anyWorn to _hasTop or _hasBottom or _hasPanties or _hasBra>>
<<if not _anyWorn>>
	&emsp;&emsp;You don't run. You don't hide. You hold perfectly still and let it pass THROUGH you. Icy fingers slide over bare skin — and find nothing left to tear away. The ghost pauses. Then, curious and patient, it decides to take you instead.<br>
	<<thought>>You feel the cold close around you and pull. There is nothing left to give but yourself.<</thought>>
	<<run setup.HuntController.rearmHuntTimer()>>
	<br><br>
	@@.usebtn;<<link "Surrender to the cold" setup.HuntController.huntOverPassage("sanity")>>
	<</link>>@@
<<else>>
	<<run setup.Mc.addTempCorr(0.5)>>
	&emsp;&emsp;You don't run. You don't hide. You hold perfectly still and let it pass THROUGH you. Icy fingers slide over you; the ghost pauses, curious — and strips every stitch loose before drifting on. Your skin crawls, but you can feel the residue it left behind. Every tool you were carrying picks up the trail.
	<br>
	/% The freeze takes every worn garment; each Steal* leaf passage (and the no-media shirt branch) calls setup.HuntController.stealClothes(piece), which both strips the wardrobe slot and stashes a clothesStolen<Piece> pin on the floor plan. %/
	<<if _hasTop>>
		<<run setup.HuntController.stealClothes("shirt")>>
		@@.mc-action; Your top is gone.@@<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if _hasBottom>>
		<<include "StealBottomOuter">>
		@@.mc-action; Your bottoms are gone.@@<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if _hasPanties>>
		<<include "StealPanties">>
		@@.mc-action; Your panties are gone.@@<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if _hasBra>>
		<<include "StealBra">>
		@@.mc-action; Your bra is gone.@@<br>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	@@.backbtn;[[Continue|$return]]@@

	<<run setup.Hunt.emit(setup.Hunt.Event.PROWL_EVENT)>>
	<<run setup.HuntController.rearmHuntTimer()>>
	<<done>>
		<<addclass ".linkselector" "disabled-link">>
	<</done>>
<</if>>
